The server will start at `http://127.0.0.1:8081`.

## Configuration

Configuration is loaded from:
1. Default values
2. Config files in the `config/` directory (based on the `RUN_ENV` environment variable)
3. Environment variables prefixed with `APP_`

Example configuration file (`config/development.toml`):
```toml
[server]
host = "127.0.0.1"
port = 8081

[jwt]
secret_key = "your_super_secret_key_change_this_in_production"
expiration = 86400  # 24 hours in seconds

[rate_limit]
authenticated_rate = 60
unauthenticated_rate = 10

api_version = "v1"
```

## Project Structure

```
api_server/
├── Cargo.toml              # Project dependencies
├── src/
